From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winegstreamer: Add an HEVC decoder transform.

Media Foundation had no HEVC decoder, so anything asking whether this
machine can decode H.265 was told no. GStreamer decodes it, and the same
transform that serves H.264 serves this.

With it, MFTEnumEx for MFVideoFormat_HEVC finds the transform and a caller
can build, configure and feed it.

Signed-off-by: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/dlls/winegstreamer/unixlib.h
+++ b/dlls/winegstreamer/unixlib.h
@@ -71,6 +71,7 @@
